<title>USA: Escalon Medical says pres/COO steps down.</title>
<headline>Escalon Medical says pres/COO steps down.</headline>
<dateline>SKILLMAN, N.J. 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Escalon Medical Corp said Tuesday that Sterling Johnson stepped down as president and chief operating officer effective April 30 &quot;to pursue other opportunities.&quot;</p>
<p>Johnson will stay on the board, the company said.</p>
<p>Escalon Chairman and Chief Executive Richard DePiano will assume the responsibilities of president, the company said.</p>
<p>Escalon said it has no plans of filling the COO position.</p>
</text>
